{"patch": {"id": "sourceRecord-ev-66f56ee8e292", "set": {"excerpt": "Diploma Eligibility List Wageningen University 2026 intake Appendix 2 - International Baccalaureate DP Diploma Data Science for Global Challenges* Mathematics A&I (HL)/Mathematics A&A (SL/HL) + Chemistry (SL/HL)/Biology (SL/HL)/Physics (SL/HL) *These BSc programmes are English taught BSc programmes General Certificate of Secondary Education (GCSE) in at least 3 subjects with grades A*-C or 9-4 + General Certificate of Education Advanced Level (GCE A-level) in at least 3 academic subjects with grades A*-C or 9-4 (6 different subjects in total) Animal Sciences* Mathematics A&I (HL)/Mathematics A&A (SL/HL) + Chemistry (one of these three subjects has to be on HL) + Biology (SL/HL) Earth System Sciences (Soil, Water, Atmosphere)* Mathematics A&I (HL)/Mathematics A&A (SL/HL) + Chemistry + Physics (one of the two latter subjects has to be on HL) Environmental Sciences* Mathematics A&I (HL)/Mathematics A&A (SL/HL) + Chemistry + Physics (one of the two latter subjects has to be on HL) Food Technology* Mathematics A&I (HL)/Mathematics A&A (SL/HL) + Chemistry + Biology/Physics (one of the three latter subjects has to be on HL) International Land and Water Management* Mathematics A&I (HL)/Mathematics A&A (SL/HL) + Physics (SL/HL) Marine Sciences* Mathematics A&I (HL)/Mathematics A&A (SL/HL) + Chemistry + Biology (one of the two latter subjects has to be on HL)", "retrieved_at": "2026-11-27T00:00:00Z"}}}
